WEBVTT

00:05:59.746 --> 00:06:01.954
The Memory Ensemble,
as we call ourselves,

00:06:01.996 --> 00:06:04.746
is a collaboration between
the Lookingglass Theatre

00:06:04.746 --> 00:06:07.413
and Northwestern's Center
for Cognitive Neurology

00:06:07.413 --> 00:06:09.579
and Alzheimer's Disease Research.

00:06:09.579 --> 00:06:12.371
We begin each session with a mantra:

00:06:12.413 --> 00:06:14.163
"I am a creative person.

00:06:14.204 --> 00:06:16.538
When I feel anxious or uncertain,

00:06:16.579 --> 00:06:19.954
I can stop, breathe, observe

00:06:19.954 --> 00:06:21.829
and use my imagination."

00:06:22.788 --> 00:06:25.746
Anyone else feeling anxious
or uncertain right now?

00:06:26.663 --> 00:06:28.329
Let's say it together.

00:06:28.829 --> 00:06:30.913
I am a creative person.